All right, let's bring it in, please. Come in please.  Our target is a major transaction of microprocessors. Yes, those. I don't know what they are. You don't know what they are. Who gives a fuck? Cash will be handed over in a building which we have under AV surveillance. Staff Sergeant Sullivan's team...  Will ID the bad guys and listen in on the phones.
